+- **Results follow external project changes.** Autocomplete and native diagnostics discard results computed before watched PHP, Composer or resource updates finish, while open editor text is preserved. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
+
 - **Laravel route helper identity.** References, navigation, hover and unknown-route checks distinguish project helpers from Laravel's global helpers, including unsaved namespace-function changes. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
 
 - **Laravel route refactoring.** Rename unique literal route names across indexed PHP and Blade usages while preserving group prefixes, imports and template coordinates. Ambiguous, generated, colliding or stale declarations are refused. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
